        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.5.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 5:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini watu hao hawakumwelekea yeye aliyewapiga, wala kumtafuta BWANA wa majeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa sababu hiyo BWANA atakata katika Israeli kichwa na mkia, kuti na nyasi, katika siku moja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzee mwenye kuheshimiwa ndiye kichwa, na nabii afundishaye uongo ndiye mkia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa maana wawaongozao watu hawa ndio wawakoseshao, na hao walioongozwa na watu hao wameangamia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa sababu hiyo Bwana hatawafurahia vijana wao, wala hatawahurumia yatima zao wala wajane wao; maana kila mtu ni mnajisi, dhalimu, na kila ulimi hunena upumbavu. Pamoja na hayo yote hasira yake haikugeukia mbali, lakini mkono wake umenyoshwa hata sasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa maana uovu huteketeza kama moto; huila mibigili na miiba, naam, huwaka katika vichaka vya mwitu, nao hupaa juu katika mawingu mazito ya moshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa sababu ya hasira ya BWANA wa majeshi nchi hii inateketea kabisa; watu hawa nao ni kama kuni zitiwazo motoni; hapana mtu amhurumiaye ndugu yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 26:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hupokonya upande wa mkono wa kuume, nao huona njaa! Hula upande wa mkono wa kushoto, wala hawashibi! Watakula kila mtu nyama ya mkono wake mwenyewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase anamla Efraimu, naye Efraimu anamla Manase; nao wawili pamoja watakuwa juu ya Yuda. Pamoja na hayo yote hasira yake haikugeukia mbali, lakini mkono wake umenyoshwa hata sasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
